# #272: Maiev's Fan of Knives after the swap with Immolate: a front-only burst on frames 4-7 that sends foes sideways,
# and a jump cancel from its frame 4; maiev-fan-spike.pad checks the air spike and stall.
# Warden a against Warden b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero warden
# b dashes in, then a dashes to close the gap.
40 b stick -1 0
43 b stick 0 0
50 a stick 1 0
56 a stick 0 0
# Fan of Knives on the ground with b in front.
90 a stick 0 -1
90 a tap X 2
91 a stick 0 0
# a turns away from b: the burst misses b behind her.
200 a stick -0.5 0
204 a stick 0 0
240 a stick 0 -1
240 a tap X 2
241 a stick 0 0
# a turns back: from the same spot the burst reaches b in front.
300 a stick 0.5 0
304 a stick 0 0
340 a stick 0 -1
340 a tap X 2
341 a stick 0 0
# Fan of Knives in the air, cancelled by a double jump on the first frame it allows (its frame 4 has passed).
420 a tap B 8
432 a stick 0 -1
432 a tap X 2
433 a stick 0 0
436 a tap B 2
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): b in front is struck on frame 4 and sent sideways; from the
# same spot b behind is untouched; the jump cancels it in the air.
#! expect a 90 special 16 form 0 action-frame 1 x 2.880
#! absent b 90-92 damage
#! expect b 93 damage 6.106 hitlag 5 hitstun 17
#! expect b 93 launch up 0 from-air 0 x 7.990 z 0.000
#! expect a 200 ground action 0 facing -1
#! expect a 240 special 16 form 0 action-frame 1 x -0.389
#! absent b 240-266 damage
#! expect a 300 ground action 0 facing 1
#! expect a 340 special 16 form 0 action-frame 1 x 2.880
#! expect b 343 damage 15.212 hitlag 5 hitstun 20
#! expect b 343 launch up 0 from-air 0 x 9.181 z 0.000
#! expect a 432 special 16 form 1 action-frame 1 x 2.880 z 158.700
#! expect a 436 special 0 form 1 action-frame 0 x 2.880 z 179.676
#! expect a 436 applied jump 2 double 1
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
1000 a press VIEW
1070 a release VIEW
